#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:7
msgid ""
"Characters are the features recorded when describing a fungus, such as Cap "
"Width or Gill Attachment. For each one, this site gives its name and "
"scientific name, definition, value type and, where there is a list to choose "
"from, its value options. The goal is data that anyone can use and everyone "
"can help maintain."
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:12
msgid "View it here"
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:13
#, python-format
