msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:17
msgid "Get the data"
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:18
msgid ""
"Download the complete set as a dated release: Excel, CSV, JSON, SQL, SKOS "
"and SDD. Free to use in any way (CC0)."
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:22
msgid "Add and edit"
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:23
msgid ""
"Sign up and sign in to add characters, value options, value types and "
"sources, and to edit what you added. Every change is public, showing who "
"made it and why."
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:28
msgid "Help bring the site and its characters into your language."
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:34
msgid "Where people disagree"
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:35
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Mycologists and collectors do not always agree on terms or on values. On "
"fungalcharacters.org, each character and value option shows its source, and "
"every change is kept in a public history that shows who changed what, when "
"and why, so earlier wording is never lost. Ultimately, users decide which "
"characters and values live on. Thanks on the <a "
"href=\"%(thanks_url)s\">Thanks</a> page does not mean anyone named there "
"endorses any value on the site."
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:36
msgid "Open tools and public data to improve the accuracy of fungal data."
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:38
msgid "No advice about consumption"
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/home.html:39
msgid ""
"fungalcharacters.org records how sources describe fungi. It is not a guide "
"to eating, using or handling any fungus, and nothing here says whether any "
"fungus is safe. Values about chemistry or toxicity are reported only as "
"their source states them."
msgstr ""

